No Linux kernel source files are vendored. The module's replacement functions
are written for this project on top of exported Linux kernel interfaces. Its
replacements for pci_read_config_word() and pci_write_config_word() repeat the
few lines of the kernel functions they replace (a disconnect check and the
bus-level config access), as the livepatch mechanism requires. Its structure
follows the kernel's samples/livepatch/livepatch-sample.c. This notice states
