No NVIDIA software is included
------------------------------

This repository contains no NVIDIA binaries, driver objects, firmware,
vgpuConfig.xml files, or decompiled NVIDIA code. The user supplies the NVIDIA
vGPU-KVM host driver package, guest drivers and any NVIDIA license under
NVIDIA's own terms. NVIDIA, GeForce, RTX and related marks are trademarks of
NVIDIA Corporation. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA.

The driver patcher (driver/) modifies a copy of the user's own
nv-kernel.o_binary on the user's machine; the patched file is never part of this
repository.

